    'Do <strong>not</strong> set a Reorder Minimum you do not mean. A minimum of 0 means "not tracked" and the part never flags.',
    'Do <strong>not</strong> leave a defect\'s Parts Needed empty when you know what the repair takes — that is how the office knows what to order before the machine is on the bench.',
